WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.700
I call it pure evil.

00:01.740 --> 00:04.500
So they've taken away his freedom of speech,

00:04.540 --> 00:07.600
and now they've taken away his freedom of movement.

00:07.640 --> 00:11.940
I mean, they had more allowances for Khalid Sheikh Mohammed.

00:11.980 --> 00:14.440
Oh, okay.

00:14.480 --> 00:15.980
That sounds wild.

00:16.020 --> 00:18.320
But I think Jesse Watters is a reasonable man,

00:18.360 --> 00:21.020
because I was kicked in the head by a horse last week.

00:21.060 --> 00:23.220
So...

00:23.260 --> 00:24.320
Let's hear him out.

00:24.360 --> 00:26.600
How is Trump being treated worse

00:26.620 --> 00:28.960
than the mastermind of 9-11?

00:28.960 --> 00:31.460
The guy needs exercise. He's usually golfing.

00:31.500 --> 00:33.740
And so you're gonna put a man who's almost 80

00:33.760 --> 00:36.760
sitting in a room like this on his butt for all that time?

00:36.800 --> 00:39.400
It's not healthy. He needs sunlight, and he needs activity.

00:39.440 --> 00:41.800
He needs to be walking around. He needs action.

00:41.840 --> 00:44.240
It's really cruel and unusual punishment

00:44.280 --> 00:45.980
to make a man do that.

00:46.020 --> 00:47.920
Are we talking about Donald Trump

00:47.940 --> 00:49.780
or an old English sheepdog?

00:49.820 --> 00:50.880
Yeah.

00:50.920 --> 00:52.180
You can't keep him cooped up all day.

00:52.220 --> 00:54.460
He needs time outside, or he'll pee on the couch.

